# CONTRACTS — schema_ledger.json (v2.2.8)

Ledger F06 des **lots**. Cle = token `L-XXX` (pas la date, pas PARI-YYYYMMDD).
Producteur : `/valider-2` (snapshot T0). Consommateurs : `/data ledger`,
`/status ledger`, `/roi settle L-XXX`. **F06 n'apprend pas** : settle ecrit
G/P/EN_ATTENTE + PnL FC, jamais `calibration.json`.

## Unites

- Jour = `/start` → `PARI-YYYYMMDD` (bankroll, plafond eventuel)
- Lot = chaque `/valider-2` → token `L-K7M` (tickets + snapshot T0)
- Exclusion (par capture, jusqu'au `/stop`) : `(match_id, marche, selection)`

## Schema

```json
{
  "lots": [
    {
      "token": "L-K7M",
      "campagne": "PARI-20261031",
      "capture_id": "C-AB3",
      "created_at": "ISO8601",
      "status": "OUVERT|SETTLE_PARTIEL|SETTLE",
      "budget_fc": 3000,
      "surticket_fc": 800,
      "alloue_fc": 3000,
      "consumed_legs": [
        {"match_id": "M3", "marche": "1X2", "selection": "1"}
      ],
      "snapshot_t0": {
        "generated_at": "ISO8601",
        "tickets": [],
        "budget": {"budget_fc": 3000, "alloue_fc": 3000, "reste_fc": 0}
      },
      "settle": {
        "settled_at": "ISO8601|null",
        "source": "football-data.co.uk",
        "tickets": [
          {
            "rang_ticket": 1,
            "resultat": "G|P|EN_ATTENTE",
            "pnl_fc": 0,
            "jambes": [
              {
                "match_id": "M3",
                "match": "Arsenal vs Chelsea",
                "marche": "1X2",
                "selection": "1",
                "resultat": "G|P|EN_ATTENTE"
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
```

## Regles

1. 1 `/valider-2` = 1 token. Append, n'ecrase pas les lots precedents.
2. Snapshot T0 fige cotes, p, EV, score, qualite, budget. Modifier top3 apres coup ne change pas le lot.
3. Settle : CSV ligue/date football-data.co.uk. Match absent → `EN_ATTENTE`, jamais invente.
4. `/stop` ne touche pas les lots deja figes.
